  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Back to School Emergency Campaign</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the ongoing economic crisis, it has become extremely difficult for students in Lebanon to continue their education. After the success of last year&apos;s project, URDA is relaunching the Back to School Emergency Campaign for this school year. We aim to support students to continue their education journey by providing them with student sponsorships, school bags and stationary, and transportation support.</narrative>
  </description>
